  Backend engineer with 6 years building payment infrastructure.
  Acme Corp|Senior Backend Engineer|2021-01|Present|Owns the checkout and payments platform.|Cut checkout latency 40% by migrating to Kafka-based retries;Led a 3-person team building the fraud-detection pipeline
  OpenLedger|Open-source double-entry ledger library|TypeScript,PostgreSQL||2022-01|
